  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Ruinous and restorative power alike flow from your will.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Admixture), Life sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Admixture, you may spend an additional spell point to have a single creature that takes damage be targeted by a cure, invigorate, or restore. If you possess the Mass Healing talent, you may apply the cure, invigorate, or restore to all targets damaged, up to your maximum targets from Mass Healing. A Life sphere effect which would deal damage (such as a cure on an undead or in conjunction with the Affliction talent) instead deals no damage when used with this feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/admixture-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
